<section class="section services" id="services" aria-labelledby="svc-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
        <h2 class="display-lg" id="svc-h">Smarter systems. Smoother clinic operations.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="body-lg muted">Four ways we take repetitive work off your front desk. Most clinics start with one workflow and add more once the team trusts it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="svc-list">
      <article class="svc rv">
        <span class="svc-num">01</span>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <h3>Online booking &amp; scheduling automation</h3>
          <p>Patients book from your website, Google profile or WhatsApp, and the appointment lands in your schedule without a single phone call.</p>
          <details>
            <summary><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>Learn more</summary>
            <ul>
              <li>Take booking requests 24/7 from web, Google and WhatsApp</li>
              <li>Offer real open slots from your calendar</li>
              <li>Write confirmed bookings into your practice software</li>
            </ul>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mini-flow">
            <div class="node"><b>Booking request</b><span class="mono">web.form</span></div><span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="node ai"><div class="row-t"><b>Read request</b><span class="badge badge--ai">AI</span></div><span class="mono">treatment, time</span></div><span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <div class="node"><b>Schedule</b><span class="mono">create appt</span></div>
          </div>
          <span class="mini-cap">Works for every request, even at 11pm.</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc rv">
        <span class="svc-num">02</span>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <h3>Reminders &amp; no-show prevention</h3>
          <p>Confirmations and reminders go out by SMS, WhatsApp and email. Patients confirm or reschedule in one tap, so a cancellation becomes a filled slot instead of an empty chair.</p>
          <details>
            <summary><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>Learn more</summary>
            <ul>
              <li>Confirmation and reminder messages on your schedule</li>
              <li>One-tap confirm, cancel or reschedule</li>
              <li>Offer cancelled slots to a waitlist automatically</li>
            </ul>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pipe">
            <div class="pipe-col"><span>Booked</span><div class="chip">Check-up<span class="mono">Tue 09:30</span></div><div class="chip">Cleaning<span class="mono">Wed 14:00</span></div></div>
            <div class="pipe-col"><span>Reminded</span><div class="chip moving">Filling<span class="mono">sms · T-24h</span></div></div>
            <div class="pipe-col"><span>Confirmed</span><div class="chip">Whitening<span class="mono">replied yes</span></div></div>
          </div>
          <span class="mini-cap">Cancelled slots go to the waitlist on their own.</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc rv">
        <span class="svc-num">03</span>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <h3>Patient recall &amp; reactivation</h3>
          <p>Bring patients back for check-ups and cleanings on time, and reach the ones who haven't visited in over a year, without anyone working through a spreadsheet.</p>
          <details>
            <summary><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>Learn more</summary>
            <ul>
              <li>Recall reminders at 6 and 12 months</li>
              <li>Reactivation messages for lapsed patients</li>
              <li>Review requests after each visit</li>
            </ul>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="hub">
            <div class="hub-tools">
              <div class="chip">Check-up due</div>
              <div class="chip">Cleaning overdue</div>
              <div class="chip">No visit in 12 months</div>
              <div class="chip">Treatment plan open</div>
            </div>
            <div class="hub-lines"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 140" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 17 C20 17 20 70 40 70"/><path d="M0 52 C20 52 20 70 40 70"/><path d="M0 88 C20 88 20 70 40 70"/><path d="M0 123 C20 123 20 70 40 70"/></svg></div>
            <div class="node"><b>Recall workflow</b><span class="mono">recall.weekly()</span><span class="mini-cap" style="margin-top:6px">Sends each list the right message every week</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc rv">
        <span class="svc-num">04</span>
        <div class="svc-body">
          <h3>AI front-desk assistant</h3>
          <p>An AI assistant answers common questions, sorts incoming messages by urgency and drafts replies for your team, inside the tools your reception already uses.</p>
          <details>
            <summary><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>Learn more</summary>
            <ul>
              <li>Answer questions on hours, prices, insurance and directions</li>
              <li>Sort WhatsApp and email by urgency</li>
              <li>Hand anything clinical straight to your staff</li>
            </ul>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="prompt">
            <div class="row-t" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><b style="font-size:13px;font-weight:500">Patient inbox assistant</b><span class="badge badge--ai">AI</span></div>
            <span class="mono"><span class="k">in  </span>"My tooth has ached since last night, can I come in today?"
<span class="k">out </span>&#123; intent: "emergency", urgency: "high",
      action: "offer same-day slot", draft: ready &#125;</span>
          </div>
          <span class="mini-cap">Your team reviews the reply before it is sent.</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
